          "publishTime": "2026-02-18T12:47:04.680359056Z"
        },
        {
          "text": "Alex has made a real difference to my padel game. I used to feel awkward on court, and now every lesson is relaxed and fun while I can see clear progress.\n\nShe adjusts easily to each player: she also coaches my partner, who plays at a much higher level, and keeps him challenged too.\n\nHer background in competitive tennis shows in how she explains technique and footwork. She also teaches our son tennis and swimming and is wonderful with children, calm and encouraging.\n\nWhether it is padel, tennis or swimming, we are very glad we found her and recommend her to anyone.",
